  "notes": "LRCGET desktop (Tauri) app captured with the lyrics editor modal open in Synced mode. Signature hot-pink (#f35697) for primary actions, active segment, scrubber and start-timestamp chips (pink #ffd9e2 bg); end timestamps in amber chips (#fef3c7 / #b45309); green dot marks each synced line. Word-level sync strip divides the selected line into equal word cells with a pink marker for the next word. Track list status badges: dark-green 'Synced', gradient 'Word Synced', grey 'Instrumental'. Uppercase bold pill buttons throughout. Plain mode (live) shows a monospace line-numbered text editor with zoom. Save split-button opens a publish/export popover. Proposed new-entry timed-text-sync-editor for the synced lyrics editor."
